     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Hi Jakson!</span><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">I&#39;m trying to customize a hotkey without success.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">map &lt;silent&gt; &lt;LocalLeader&gt;hh :call g:SendCmdToR(&quot;render(&#39;input.Rmd&#39;,&#39;ioslides_presentation&#39;)&quot;) <br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Where is the error?</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Thank&#39;s!</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "4LbQ7Ia8KwAJ",
   "from": "Jakson Alves de Aquino",
   "author": "b256a2742aacd200",
   "date": "2016-05-17T20:19:08Z",
   "subject": "Re: Customizing hotkey!",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Ivan,<div><br></div><div>The problems are:</div><div><ul><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\">In this case, it is better to restrict the command to Normal mode: nmap</span></li><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\">The name of the file should be dynamically defined: expand(&quot;%&quot;)</span></li><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\">The final carriage return is missing: &lt;CR&gt;</span></li></ul><div>So, try this:</div></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">nmap </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&lt;silent&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#606\">LocalLeader</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hh </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">call g</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#606\">SendCmdToR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;render(&#39;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">expand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;%&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">).</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&#39;,&#39;ioslides_presentation&#39;)&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">CR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span></div></code></div><br>Best,</div><div><br></div><div>Jakson</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
}
